<title>INDIA: Buoyant Delhi share index jumps 2.0 pct.</title>
<headline>Buoyant Delhi share index jumps 2.0 pct.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Delhi Stock Exchange index on Tuesday closed up 17.59 points, or 2.0 percent, at 865.23 points after India's ruling United Front coalition decided to postpone a decision on raising oil prices.</p>
</text>
